              "# Trump delays next China tariff hike\n## Quick Fix\n**— President Donald Trump has pushed back the next round of tariff hikes on $250 billion in Chinese imports by two weeks.**\n\n**— Negotiations between House Democrats and the Trump administration over the USMCA have regained momentum** now that U.S. Trade Representative Robert Lighthizer has sent formal responses to Capitol Hill",
