              "**Telltale signs:** Lighthizer spoke last week with Indian Commerce Minister Piyush Goyal to gauge the feasibility of an agreement, a source familiar with the call told Adam. Trump also met with Modi at the G-7 last month, where the conversation focused on a possible deal to be announced at this month’s United Nations General Assembly in New York",
              "The beleaguered export finance agency’s authorization is set to expire at the end of this month.",
